1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,950
Section 2

2
00:00:01,950 --> 00:00:03,658
Hello everyone.

3
00:00:03,658 --> 00:00:08,408
I'm Jake Stevens and I'm your rep here at the hotel I'm sure you'll

4
00:00:08,408 --> 00:00:10,830
all have a great time here.

5
00:00:10,830 --> 00:00:14,875
So let me tell you a bit about what's on offer.

6
00:00:14,875 --> 00:00:20,022
I'll start by telling you about some of the excursions that are available for

7
00:00:20,022 --> 00:00:20,390
guests.

8
00:00:20,390 --> 00:00:25,470
One thing you have to do while you're here is go dolphin watching.

9
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:30,889
On our boat trips, we pretty well guarantee you'll see dolphins - if you

10
00:00:30,889 --> 00:00:34,640
don't you can repeat the trip free of charge.

11
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:38,211
We organise daily trips for just 35 euros.

12
00:00:38,211 --> 00:00:42,674
Unfortunately there aren't any places left for this afternoon's trip,

13
00:00:42,674 --> 00:00:48,030
but come and see me to book for later in the week.

14
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:52,510
If you're energetic, I'd recommend our forest walk.

15
00:00:52,510 --> 00:00:56,990
It's a guided walk of about seven kilometres.

16
00:00:56,990 --> 00:00:59,498
There'll be a stop half way,

17
00:00:59,498 --> 00:01:03,260
and you'll be provided with a drink and sandwiches.

18
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:06,848
There's some fairly steep climbs up the hills,

19
00:01:06,848 --> 00:01:12,678
so you need to be reasonably fit for this one with good shoes,

20
00:01:12,678 --> 00:01:16,265
and bring a waterproof in case it rains.

21
00:01:16,265 --> 00:01:18,956
It's just 25 euros all inclusive,

22
00:01:18,956 --> 00:01:20,750
and it's every Wednesday.

23
00:01:20,750 --> 00:01:24,238
Then on Thursdays we organise a cycle trip,

24
00:01:24,238 --> 00:01:29,470
which will give you all the fun of biking without the effort.

25
00:01:29,470 --> 00:01:35,206
We'll take you and your bike up to the top of Mount Larna,

26
00:01:35,206 --> 00:01:41,384
and leave you to bike back - it's a 700-metre drop in just 20 kilometres

27
00:01:41,384 --> 00:01:47,120
so this isn't really for inexperienced cyclists as you'll be going pretty fast.

28
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:52,140
And if it's a clear day, you'll have fantastic views.

29
00:01:52,140 --> 00:01:58,414
On our local craft tour you can find out about the traditional activities in

30
00:01:58,414 --> 00:01:59,310
the island.

31
00:01:59,310 --> 00:02:04,594
And the best thing about this trip is that it's completely free.

32
00:02:04,594 --> 00:02:08,998
You'll be taken to a factory where jewellery is made,

33
00:02:08,998 --> 00:02:11,200
and also a ceramics centre.

34
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:15,393
If you want, you can buy some of the products

35
00:02:15,393 --> 00:02:17,909
but that's entirely up to you.

36
00:02:17,909 --> 00:02:20,844
The trip starts after lunch on Thursday,

37
00:02:20,844 --> 00:02:23,360
and you'll return by 6 pm.

38
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:28,596
If you're interested in astronomy you may already know that the island's one of

39
00:02:28,596 --> 00:02:32,710
the best places in the world to observe the night sky.

40
00:02:32,710 --> 00:02:38,370
We can offer trips to the observatory on Friday for those who are interested.

41
00:02:38,370 --> 00:02:43,864
They cost 90 euros per person and you'll be shown the huge telescopes

42
00:02:43,864 --> 00:02:46,822
and have a talk from an expert,

43
00:02:46,822 --> 00:02:49,780
who'll explain all about how they work.

44
00:02:49,780 --> 00:02:54,654
Afterwards well head down to Sunset Beach, where you can have a dip in

45
00:02:54,654 --> 00:02:59,180
the ocean if you want before we head off back to the hotel.

46
00:02:59,180 --> 00:03:02,610
Finally, there's horse riding.

47
00:03:02,610 --> 00:03:06,941
This is organised by the Equestrian Centre over near Playa Cortino

48
00:03:06,941 --> 00:03:11,272
and it's a great experience if you're a keen horseback rider,

49
00:03:11,272 --> 00:03:15,210
or even if you've never been on a horse before.

50
00:03:15,210 --> 00:03:18,368
They take you down to the beach,

51
00:03:18,368 --> 00:03:23,330
and you can canter along the sand and through the waves.

52
00:03:23,330 --> 00:03:27,390
It costs 35 euros and it's available every day.

53
00:03:27,390 --> 00:03:31,821
So there's plenty to do in the daytime,

54
00:03:31,821 --> 00:03:34,590
but what about night life?

55
00:03:34,590 --> 00:03:40,250
Well, the number one attractions called 'Musical Favourites'.

56
00:03:40,250 --> 00:03:44,825
Guests enjoy a three-course meal and unlimited free drinks,

57
00:03:44,825 --> 00:03:50,418
and watch a fantastic show, starting with musicals set in Paris

58
00:03:50,418 --> 00:03:56,010
and then crossing the Atlantic to Las Vegas and finally Copacabana.

59
00:03:56,010 --> 00:04:01,313
At the end the cast members come down from the stage, still in their

60
00:04:01,313 --> 00:04:02,071
stunning costumes,

61
00:04:02,071 --> 00:04:05,480
and you'll have a chance to chat with them.

62
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:06,771
It's hugely popular,

63
00:04:06,771 --> 00:04:12,798
so let me know now if you're interested because it's no good leaving it

64
00:04:12,798 --> 00:04:14,520
until the last minute.

65
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:16,246
It's on Friday night.

66
00:04:16,246 --> 00:04:18,836
Tickets are just 50 euros each,

67
00:04:18,836 --> 00:04:24,878
but for an extra 10 euros you can have a table right by the

68
00:04:24,878 --> 00:04:25,310
stage.

69
00:04:25,310 --> 00:04:31,293
If you'd like to go back in time, there's the Castle Feast on Saturday

70
00:04:31,293 --> 00:04:31,720
evening.

71
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:34,511
It's held in a twelfth-century castle,

72
00:04:34,511 --> 00:04:41,025
and you eat in the great courtyard, with ladies in long gowns serving your

73
00:04:41,025 --> 00:04:41,490
food.

74
00:04:41,490 --> 00:04:44,117
You're given a whole chicken each,

75
00:04:44,117 --> 00:04:49,808
which you eat in the medieval way, using your hands instead of cutlery,

76
00:04:49,808 --> 00:04:55,937
and you're entertained by competitions where the horseback riders attempt to knock one another

77
00:04:55,937 --> 00:04:57,250
off their horses.

78
00:04:57,250 --> 00:05:03,276
Then you can watch the dancers in the ballroom and join in as well

79
00:05:03,276 --> 00:05:04,568
if you want.

80
00:05:04,568 --> 00:05:04,998
OK,

81
00:05:04,998 --> 00:05:06,720
so now if anyone...
